ble below to change the limits from $x$ to $u.$\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $12$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can now write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{4}\\frac{12}{3+27{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =4{\\int }_{0}^{4}\\frac{1}{1+(3x)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{12}\\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\,\\cdot (\\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{12}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{1+{u}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u{|}_{0}^{12} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(12)-\\frac{4}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(0) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}\\,arctan\\,(12)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535209 true] [17592186337700 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337701 13194139535209 true] [17592186337700 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535209 true] [17592186337700 1041 "field-1" 13194139535209 true] [17592186337700 1104 #edb/ref 17592186337701 13194139535209 true] [17592186337700 1110 #uuid "2038c937-5b46-5d3a-bbbf-7d9fa5c70ac3" 13194139535209 true] [17592186337701 1034 "\\frac{4}{3}" 13194139535209 true] [17592186337701 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535209 true] [17592186337701 1111 #uuid "73179cf7-0dc4-5e8f-8ada-b90c4dc580c2" 13194139535209 true] [17592186337702 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337703 13194139535209 true] [17592186337702 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535209 true] [17592186337702 1041 "field-2" 13194139535209 true] [17592186337702 1104 #edb/ref 17592186337703 13194139535209 true] [17592186337702 1110 #uuid "848e9332-aa52-5cf4-b8a7-44668b3f94fc" 13194139535209 true] [17592186337703 1034 "12" 13194139535209 true] [17592186337703 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535209 true] [17592186337703 1111 #uuid "82ba530d-ebc7-5100-b189-6ed20c074a7c" 13194139535209 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-351834" 17592186337695 "q-351834/field-1" 17592186337696 "q-351834/field-1/41750b9e1f010bfc6f4245021deeec487f9a9f365d2f8174caf96720a7a0ab1b" 17592186337697 "q-351834/field-1/f6faf3e09627fa8c7ad1f8f5e